          "end": 108.84,
          "en": "and picking multiple colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.84,
          "end": 113.84,
          "en": "I provide this colors.js file with those colors to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 116.83,
